            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "〈美股早盤〉非農意外轉負緩解Fed升息疑慮 主要指數開高",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"〈美股早盤〉非農意外轉負緩解Fed升息疑慮 主要指數開高\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d429e02a49368e14f9890072e6d0a7f178911f2aa7ffda5ab89860a2f35248c2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fca%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2F0de7ade9e311a1ddf740b1a3c774f145\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">〈美股早盤〉非農意外轉負緩解Fed升息疑慮 主要指數開高</figcaption></div></figure></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%BE%8E%E8%82%A1%E6%97%A9%E7%9B%A4-%E9%9D%9E%E8%BE%B2%E6%84%8F%E5%A4%96%E8%BD%89%E8%B2%A0%E7%B7%A9%E8%A7%A3fed%E5%8D%87%E6%81%AF%E7%96%91%E6%85%AE-%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E6%8C%87%E6%95%B8%E9%96%8B%E9%AB%98-133819819.html",
